></li><li><strong>Platforming stages:</strong> Move by running, attack with punches and squat to perform jumps!<br></li><li><strong>Slingshot stages:</strong> Use sit ups to operate a giant slingshot<br></li><li><strong>Fishing mini game:</strong> Squat to throw the line and lure the fish!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >8 terrifying bosses</h2>Face fierce enemies each with their unique pattern and weakness. <br>Are you fit enough to beat them?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651280/extras/a7dbf223bef2c56f1122153e9f21e9df.poster.avif?t=1787854319\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651280/extras/a7dbf223bef2c56f1122153e9f21e9df.webm?t=1787854319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651280/extras/a7dbf223bef2c56f1122153e9f21e9df.mp4?t=1787854319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skills to master</h2>Get in shape in life and in the game. Improve your speed, attack and more by investing in up to 22 different skills!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exercise log</h2>This exergame tracks of your fitness progress, high scores, current and previous session in order to keep you motivated to improve!", "short_description": "Blast baddies and burn calories! Burnit Quest is a mobile enhanced fitness platformer, connect your phone to your PC to and get ready to sweat!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651280/81fc166aedb7c3f22858f2027f857a89732e2bdd/header.jpg?t=1787854319", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651280/4f2ef3bb4ea7cb4eee1c59d6baf2c7cc459f5b06/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787854319", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i